sequenceDiagram
    participant API as Payment Processing
    participant DB as Database
    participant Biller as Biller Adapter
    participant Wallet as Wallet & Ledger
    participant Notif as Notifications

    API->>Biller: Send Payment Request
    Biller-->>API: Payment Refused (Error Code)

    API->>DB: Update payment status to Failed

    API->>Wallet: Release held funds

    Wallet->>DB: Check if funds were already released

    alt Funds not released before
        Wallet->>DB: Record release ledger entries
        DB-->>Wallet: Release recorded
        Wallet-->>API: Funds released successfully

        API->>DB: Update payment status to Refunded
        API->>Notif: Emit PaymentFailed event
        Notif-->>API: Notification event accepted

    else Funds already released
        DB-->>Wallet: Release already recorded
        Wallet-->>API: No additional release required
    end
